From e98a5019605baf930067ad780aeddddb81d1aabe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moto <j3tm0t0@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:39:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bootwait: logo row halfway between subtitle-aligned and
 centred (default)

BW_LOGO=between (new default): the logo row's left edge is halfway
between the (re-centred, tightened) subtitle's left edge and the
optical centre: x 204, i.e. 52 px right of bootscreen9's position.
waiter_test.py checks it lies between the two.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PrGdt1XK1exBgERrMmLA1u
